# Sulu, Heroic Helmsman (2/2): "Sulu stations Spacecraft and crews Vehicles as though his power were tripled"
# (CR 702.184a-c). Borg Cube's station ability puts charge counters on it equal to the tapped creature's power, and it has
# no toughness-special ability: Sulu's 2 stations it for 6 counters, a plain 2-power creature for 2. All on turn one, where
# three Black Lotuses pay for both Sulu ({1}{W}) and the Cube ({5}{W}{B}). The Cube's enters trigger offers to exile up to
# one target creature, and it is declined: the target of the station is Sulu. Its striation is 12+, so 6 counters leave it
# an artifact alone.

